   "en": "Every \"price?\" comment is a sale that's about to die. 👗\n\n1️⃣ You DM prices to every commenter by hand\n✅ Fix: a catalogue link with prices, colours and sizes\n\n2️⃣ \"Is medium available?\" gets answered too late\n✅ Fix: live sizes and stock on every product\n\n3️⃣ Orders scattered across chats, screenshots and a notebook\n✅ Fix: a cart that sends the order to WhatsApp, with UPI checkout\n\nSaanjh Boutique is a concept demo.\nSend this to a boutique owner who needs it.\nWant this for your boutique? Comment SHOP 👇\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated."
